WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.121 --> 00:00:16.070
As headed with Sid toward the stage, he spotted Winnie.

2
00:00:16.791 --> 00:00:20.213
She was sitting in a quiet corner, practicing tricks with Inky.

3
00:00:21.474 --> 00:00:25.557
The kitten hissed at Ben, but she mewed softly at Sid.

4
00:00:25.577 --> 00:00:29.000
"That's weird," Ben murmured.

5
00:00:29.712 --> 00:00:33.134
Sid looked surprised too as he started petting the black cat.

6
00:00:33.154 --> 00:00:35.956
"Be careful, Sid," Ben said.

7
00:00:35.976 --> 00:00:38.817
"She likes me now," Sid said.

8
00:00:38.837 --> 00:00:41.339
"And I'm not allergic to cats, remember?"

9
00:00:45.321 --> 00:00:49.043
Winnie went off to join the parade, while Ben and Sid sat down.

10
00:00:50.083 --> 00:00:53.745
A line of pets began walking across the stage and around the gym.

11
00:00:54.906 --> 00:01:00.989
There were dogs and cats, along with Cleo's jackal, Deb's piranha-keet, and Waldo's owl.

12
00:01:02.450 --> 00:01:06.371
Sid was grinning at a small dragon sitting on a skeleton's shoulder.

13
00:01:06.391 --> 00:01:08.692
"What a cool pet!"

14
00:01:10.253 --> 00:01:12.714
The dragon suddenly leaped into the air.

15
00:01:13.855 --> 00:01:19.597
Everyone oohed and aahed as it shot small puffs of flame.

16
00:01:25.380 --> 00:01:29.582
awesome!" Ben agreed as the creature dipped closer, brushing their heads.

17
00:01:29.602 --> 00:01:32.243
"Maybe we can get a pet dragon, Sid."

18
00:01:33.364 --> 00:01:35.365
But a second later, Sid groaned.

19
00:01:37.726 --> 00:01:41.168
He held up his hands, where more green spots had sprouted.

20
00:01:42.149 --> 00:01:43.029
Ben sighed.

21
00:01:44.470 --> 00:01:46.851
He and Sid were never going to find the right animal.

22
00:01:46.871 --> 00:01:50.313
"It's okay," he said, trying to sound hopeful.

23
00:01:50.333 --> 00:01:51.534
"We can keep trying.

24
00:01:52.014 --> 00:01:53.515
Maybe—" "Watch out!"

25
00:01:53.815 --> 00:01:58.157
A mummy pointed to Sid and shouted, "That ghost has monster pox!"

26
00:01:58.177 --> 00:02:00.578
"Monster pox!"

27
00:02:01.019 --> 00:02:03.340
Other monsters started screaming and pointing.

28
00:02:03.360 --> 00:02:05.261
"Monster pox!"

29
00:02:05.281 --> 00:02:07.242
"It's just an allergy!"

30
00:02:07.442 --> 00:02:08.683
Ben tried to explain.

31
00:02:09.023 --> 00:02:13.346
But there was so much screaming that nobody heard him.

32
00:02:14.366 --> 00:02:18.388
Suddenly—schwoop! The skeleton's dragon shot up into the air.

33
00:02:18.408 --> 00:02:19.349
"Look out!"

34
00:02:19.649 --> 00:02:20.310
Ben shouted.

35
00:02:20.790 --> 00:02:24.332
The dragon was flying to the wall, breathing angry flames.

36
00:02:24.904 --> 00:02:29.027
A few banners caught fire, and pets were barking and screeching.

37
00:02:29.908 --> 00:02:31.509
Mayor Hubbletree looked upset.

38
00:02:31.529 --> 00:02:34.792
"I knew this was a bad idea!"

39
00:02:35.092 --> 00:02:35.593
he said.

40
00:02:36.273 --> 00:02:39.075
Miss Bungle rushed to the microphone on the stage.

41
00:02:39.095 --> 00:02:43.599
"Everyone, please remain calm," she said.

42
00:02:43.619 --> 00:02:47.562
"Mr. Freaky, I'd like to see you immediately."

43
00:02:47.582 --> 00:02:50.364
"I'm right here!"

44
00:02:50.805 --> 00:02:53.127
Mr. Freaky called, hurrying toward the stage.

45
00:02:54.248 --> 00:02:58.303
Zoom! Ben ducked as something streaked through the air above his head again.

46
00:02:58.323 --> 00:02:59.824
"Hey! That's Winnie!"

47
00:03:00.224 --> 00:03:00.925
Sid shouted.

48
00:03:01.325 --> 00:03:02.186
Ben looked up.

49
00:03:02.887 --> 00:03:06.850
Sure enough, Winnie was on her broom, flying after the dragon.

50
00:03:06.870 --> 00:03:08.651
"Great idea, Winnie!"

51
00:03:08.991 --> 00:03:09.612
Ben thought.

52
00:03:10.112 --> 00:03:13.055
If she could catch the dragon, everything would calm down.

53
00:03:13.075 --> 00:03:17.278
"Ahh!" Winnie dodged a blast of flame.

54
00:03:19.640 --> 00:03:23.283
A second later she landed, holding the dragon by its neck.

55
00:03:24.624 --> 00:03:25.124
"Whew! Got him!"

56
00:03:26.044 --> 00:03:26.825
By now Mr.

57
00:03:26.885 --> 00:03:29.325
Freaky had joined Miss Bungle onstage.

58
00:03:30.046 --> 00:03:32.826
He banged his noses as he bent toward the microphone.

59
00:03:32.846 --> 00:03:35.387
"Everything is totally under control, students!

60
00:03:35.907 --> 00:03:37.528
The dragon has been caught."

61
00:03:37.548 --> 00:03:40.849
"Wrawck!" Deb's piranha-keet squawked loudly.

62
00:03:40.869 --> 00:03:42.969
"Everything is totally under control!"

63
00:03:43.609 --> 00:03:46.670
Ben zipped up to the microphone to make another announcement.

64
00:03:46.690 --> 00:03:49.111
"There is no monster pox!

65
00:03:49.531 --> 00:03:52.872
My brother's green spots are just a harmless allergy!

66
00:03:53.376 --> 00:03:54.937
Please do not panic!"

67
00:03:55.517 --> 00:03:58.458
Mr. Freaky took out his handkerchief and blew his noses.

68
00:04:00.099 --> 00:04:04.961
Mr. Gwarg ran around, using a fire extinguisher to put out the banner fires.

69
00:04:04.981 --> 00:04:09.903
"Whew." Ben floated back to Sid, who was standing with Mrs.

70
00:04:09.943 --> 00:04:13.805
Hubbletree. The mayor's wife nervously clutched her rainbow gecko.

71
00:04:13.825 --> 00:04:16.546
"Ben, are you sure we're safe?"

72
00:04:17.146 --> 00:04:17.727
she asked.

73
00:04:18.347 --> 00:04:19.127
Ben nodded.

74
00:04:19.147 --> 00:04:20.288
"Yes, Mrs.

75
00:04:20.348 --> 00:04:22.289
Hubbletree. Everything is fine.

76
00:04:22.529 --> 00:04:24.090
The dragon is back with its owner."

77
00:04:24.110 --> 00:04:26.291
"Oh, thank goodness!"

78
00:04:26.731 --> 00:04:27.852
Mrs. Hubbletree said.

79
00:04:27.872 --> 00:04:29.993
"I was worried about Bowie.

80
00:04:30.373 --> 00:04:32.254
He's very valuable, you know.

81
00:04:33.175 --> 00:04:34.916
He can change to any color.

82
00:04:35.596 --> 00:04:37.117
He can even match patterns!"

83
00:04:38.778 --> 00:04:40.559
Her jaw suddenly dropped open.

84
00:04:40.579 --> 00:04:42.540
"Oh my goodness!"

85
00:04:43.240 --> 00:04:46.842
She pointed at Sid's hand, which was covered with spots again.

86
00:04:47.463 --> 00:04:49.084
And now the gecko had them too.

87
00:04:49.644 --> 00:04:51.625
Bowie was mimicking Sid's spots!

88
00:04:52.486 --> 00:04:53.386
Ben groaned.

89
00:04:53.406 --> 00:05:00.390
"It looks like my little brother is allergic to geckos—along with every other pet at this show."

90
00:05:01.050 --> 00:05:03.572
Mrs. Hubbletree stared at her pet in dismay.

91
00:05:03.592 --> 00:05:06.874
"I hope these spots aren't permanent," she murmured.

92
00:05:06.894 --> 00:05:08.815
"I'd better show this to the mayor!"

93
00:05:10.116 --> 00:05:11.396
Ben gulped as Mrs.

94
00:05:11.436 --> 00:05:13.377
Hubbletree dashed over to her husband.

95
00:05:13.397 --> 00:05:19.709
"Mayor Hubbletree is going to make a huge deal of this commotion," Ben moaned.

96
00:05:20.389 --> 00:05:21.510
He grabbed Sid's arm.

97
00:05:21.530 --> 00:05:22.550
"Come on.

98
00:05:22.891 --> 00:05:24.812
Let's sit down and watch the rest of the parade.

99
00:05:25.392 --> 00:05:27.013
Mom is going to pick us up when it's over."

100
00:05:27.033 --> 00:05:29.454
"Can we look at more pets tomorrow?"

101
00:05:29.834 --> 00:05:30.675
Sid asked.

102
00:05:31.135 --> 00:05:33.476
"We still didn't find out if I'm allergic to rats."

103
00:05:33.496 --> 00:05:35.898
"Sure," Ben answered.

104
00:05:36.538 --> 00:05:38.839
But inside he was still feeling doubtful.

105
00:05:38.859 --> 00:05:41.761
"Sid had better not get his hopes up," Ben thought.

106
00:05:42.241 --> 00:05:45.983
Finding the right pet for their family felt like an impossible task.
